WEBVTT

00:01.020 --> 00:02.480
We're here!

00:02.480 --> 00:05.660
The amusement park!
We'll have lots of fun together today!

00:05.660 --> 00:08.420
Yeah! It's a welcome party for you, Maho.

00:08.420 --> 00:11.990
Let's go, Bro!
Time for our lovey-dovey date!

00:11.990 --> 00:15.870
Um, I've been wanting to ask this...

00:15.870 --> 00:19.250
What kind of relationship
do you two have?

00:19.250 --> 00:22.000
You could say I'm your love rival.

00:22.000 --> 00:24.730
I'll have him for myself now!

00:24.730 --> 00:26.760
I won't lose!

00:26.760 --> 00:28.510
Eww...

00:28.510 --> 00:31.340
Come on, Shisei!
Let's enjoy the amusement park to the fullest!

00:31.340 --> 00:35.630
Hmm. I will eat it all
from the pantry to the staff.

00:40.400 --> 00:41.770
I'M GETTING MARRIED TO A GIRL

00:41.770 --> 00:43.360
I HATE IN MY CLASS

00:43.360 --> 00:46.360
I'M GETTING MARRIED TO A GIRL
I HATE IN MY CLASS

02:01.270 --> 02:05.980
I'M GETTING MARRIED TO A GIRL
I HATE IN MY CLASS

02:05.980 --> 02:10.490
#9 SISTER'S HEART

02:17.240 --> 02:19.240
ICE HALL

02:19.810 --> 02:21.750
Hang in there!

02:42.770 --> 02:44.150
That was fun!

02:44.150 --> 02:45.430
It sure was!

02:48.220 --> 02:50.020
She's fainted...

02:50.020 --> 02:52.330
Oh, it has not started yet?

02:52.330 --> 02:56.280
This is not scary at all.
Rollercoasters are a piece of cake.

02:56.280 --> 02:58.820
Akane, the battle's already over...

02:58.820 --> 03:01.050
Battle? What are you saying?

03:01.050 --> 03:04.020
A rollercoaster is just like a tricycle.

03:04.020 --> 03:06.540
I am the woman able
to conquer roller coasters!

03:10.610 --> 03:13.850
You're really scared of this stuff, huh?

03:13.850 --> 03:17.300
No, it's not that! I just can't fathom
why these things exist!

03:17.300 --> 03:20.060
It's humans' fault for
making things like this!

03:20.060 --> 03:24.560
Humanity is the root of all evil...
If there's no humanity in this world...

03:24.560 --> 03:28.860
When Shisei was six,
the gondola we rode got to the top...

03:28.860 --> 03:30.650
Stop! Yeah, that's right!

03:30.650 --> 03:32.930
I hate most of the attractions
in an amusement park,

03:32.930 --> 03:35.320
including thrill rides and ferris wheels!

03:35.320 --> 03:38.700
Just kill me already, will you?!

03:38.700 --> 03:42.500
You hate it so much,
yet why are you here?

03:42.500 --> 03:43.680
It's Maho...

03:44.220 --> 03:46.000
I wanted to make her happy.

03:46.470 --> 03:51.550
You see, she loves fun things,
such as amusement parks and festivals.

03:51.550 --> 03:56.380
And she loves going there with everyone,
not just by herself.

03:56.760 --> 04:01.580
Must be because she was
always bedridden as a child.

04:01.580 --> 04:03.690
I guess it recoiled, then?

04:03.690 --> 04:07.770
She's always felt sad all the time.

04:08.090 --> 04:13.010
That's why I want to make her
wish come true in any way I can.

04:13.010 --> 04:17.280
At least I want to be with her
while she's in Japan.

04:18.570 --> 04:20.030
Want to hold hands?

04:20.030 --> 04:22.350
Huh? That's so out of nowhere!

04:22.350 --> 04:24.790
Trying to pull something funny
just because we're alone?!

04:24.790 --> 04:28.990
I just thought maybe you'd get
less scared if we hold hands.

04:28.990 --> 04:30.790
That's so uncalled for.

04:37.390 --> 04:40.620
You're a reliable big sister, huh.

04:46.060 --> 04:47.340
HAUNTED HOUSE

04:47.340 --> 04:48.540
HAUNTED HOUSE
There, there.

04:48.540 --> 04:51.460
Wow, it's really well done!

04:51.460 --> 04:55.820
Hey, Bro! This is the first time
I saw a zombie this realistic!

04:56.410 --> 04:58.260
Let's take a picture to commemorate!

04:59.140 --> 05:03.320
It's just like the real deal...
It even can drool like a real one.

05:07.290 --> 05:10.630
Maybe a haunted house isn't for you?

05:10.630 --> 05:14.340
Huh? Why? I love haunted houses.

05:14.340 --> 05:17.340
It's fun to see those coming in with me
get scared by the ghosts!

05:17.340 --> 05:18.460
Is that bullying?!

05:18.900 --> 05:20.540
What's wrong?

05:22.310 --> 05:24.740
I'm just feeling sick...

05:25.190 --> 05:27.970
Maybe I'm tired from all the frolicking...

05:28.320 --> 05:29.360
You okay?

05:29.830 --> 05:33.250
I don't think I can walk on my own...

05:33.250 --> 05:34.620
Okay, then.

05:35.180 --> 05:36.070
Hop on.

05:37.100 --> 05:39.490
Are you taking prescriptions?

05:40.510 --> 05:42.740
I'll go get Akane.

05:43.770 --> 05:45.820
Yay, I was just kidding!

05:45.820 --> 05:48.740
I just wanted you to piggyback me!

05:49.050 --> 05:51.140
Huh? You were?

05:51.140 --> 05:53.510
To think you'd be fooled
by something like this...

05:53.510 --> 05:55.750
You really are a virgin!

05:55.750 --> 05:59.070
Don't fake sick anymore!
I was really worried, you know!

05:59.070 --> 06:02.010
Huh? You were worried about me?

06:02.010 --> 06:03.500
Of course!

06:03.500 --> 06:07.590
What would you do if you actually
got sick and no one believed you?

06:07.980 --> 06:12.020
If the ambulance came too late,
it'd be all too late for everything!

06:12.020 --> 06:14.370
You don't have to be so angry...

06:14.370 --> 06:18.470
I will, until you understand
the gravity of this situation.

06:19.780 --> 06:22.770
See, I'm perfectly fine!

06:23.780 --> 06:28.560
Anyway, don't make this kind
of joke anymore. It shocks me.

06:28.560 --> 06:31.080
Sorry...

06:34.230 --> 06:35.790
I'm so beat...

06:42.550 --> 06:43.350
You...

06:43.350 --> 06:44.430
Ssh.

06:44.430 --> 06:48.700
Don't scream, or you'll be in trouble
if my sister comes here.

06:48.700 --> 06:50.470
What are you doing here?!

06:50.470 --> 06:53.850
Isn't it obvious? A sneak visit at night.

06:58.940 --> 07:01.140
I want to ask you something.

07:01.140 --> 07:02.300
What?

07:02.300 --> 07:05.980
Weren't you at my grandpa's party
long ago?

07:05.980 --> 07:07.200
What party?

07:07.730 --> 07:11.630
The one held at a villa right after
my primary school graduation.

07:12.150 --> 07:15.310
You look like just that girl I met there.

07:15.310 --> 07:17.550
She had long hair and a pretty face.

07:18.080 --> 07:21.960
We talked a lot together,
but I never asked her name...

07:21.960 --> 07:24.500
Sounds like you're talking
about your first love.

07:24.500 --> 07:25.670
That's not actually...

07:25.670 --> 07:27.930
Could she be...

07:28.810 --> 07:30.460
Want me to tell you?

07:31.490 --> 07:33.970
That-was-me.

07:34.980 --> 07:36.510
We've finally met.

07:37.020 --> 07:40.480
You've been thinking
about me that long, huh?

07:40.480 --> 07:42.100
Hey...

07:42.100 --> 07:46.990
Come on, we can marry each other
since you love me.

07:47.330 --> 07:50.420
In that case, something like this
is the norm, right?

07:50.420 --> 07:52.990
Shouldn't we get to know each other first?

07:52.990 --> 07:55.660
I love you, Brother.

07:55.660 --> 07:58.000
I'll make sure you have lots of fun.

07:58.670 --> 08:02.130
You actually hate me, don't you?

08:03.170 --> 08:06.510
What are you saying?
I even confessed to you...

08:06.510 --> 08:10.890
No matter how carefully you mend it,
I'll know if you're just being superficial.

08:11.290 --> 08:15.020
Your words don’t have
the same strength as Akane’s.

08:15.020 --> 08:17.930
That's right.
I hate you so much.

08:19.150 --> 08:21.770
But to hell with that!

08:22.270 --> 08:23.730
Let me at least kiss you!

08:24.210 --> 08:27.990
It's my first kiss, you know!
Any guy would kill for this!

08:27.990 --> 08:32.090
I can't really understand why you want
to kiss someone you really hate!

08:32.090 --> 08:33.240
Care to elaborate first?!

08:33.240 --> 08:36.300
Shut up! I'll do that
after I'm done with you!

08:36.300 --> 08:39.470
I can finally perceive you
as Akane's sister now!

08:39.470 --> 08:41.250
You're so outrageous!

08:42.190 --> 08:44.780
Wh-Wha...

08:48.260 --> 08:51.730
I just ate your husband.

08:51.730 --> 08:52.800
Thanks for the meal.

08:52.800 --> 08:57.020
Wait, stay calm, Akane!
Let me explain to you how it came to this...

08:57.020 --> 08:59.530
I hate both of you!

09:07.030 --> 09:09.050
Well? What say we sleep outside?

09:09.050 --> 09:11.240
I'd love to avoid that.

09:12.720 --> 09:16.290
You can just go back to your home.
I'll take you there.

09:17.180 --> 09:19.210
Are you one of those escort gentlemen?

09:19.210 --> 09:20.340
No way.

09:20.340 --> 09:23.790
You're going back home?
Then let me stay from time to time!

09:24.260 --> 09:28.940
It'd be lovely if Shisei could let me stay over
for a night, but I guess I'd be a bother.

09:29.780 --> 09:32.050
Oh, well. Guess I'll find a hotel.

09:32.050 --> 09:33.670
A love hotel it is, huh?

09:33.670 --> 09:35.120
Just your normal business hotel.

09:35.120 --> 09:38.160
I'll go with you! It'll be sad
if you spend the night alone!

09:38.160 --> 09:39.310
Just go home.

09:39.310 --> 09:43.400
Come on, let's go, Bro!
To the night life!

09:49.070 --> 09:50.000
See ya.

09:50.000 --> 09:54.570
Hey, you idiot!
Good-for-nothing virgin boy!

09:54.570 --> 09:55.820
It's occupied.

09:55.820 --> 09:58.880
Open up! Or I'll breach this door!

09:58.880 --> 10:01.360
- Be my guest.
- Not with my foot!

10:01.360 --> 10:03.080
I'll break in with a fire extinguisher!

10:03.080 --> 10:06.840
I'll scream that I'm being dragged to a hotel
without my parents' permission!

10:06.840 --> 10:08.970
I guess this will be abduction of a minor?

10:08.970 --> 10:10.840
Let's talk inside...

10:12.060 --> 10:13.840
Now that I'm in, you're mine!

10:13.840 --> 10:15.510
I have claimed this room!

10:15.510 --> 10:17.850
Anyway, stop pointing
that fire extinguisher at me!

10:19.290 --> 10:21.510
Get out now.

10:21.510 --> 10:24.100
Are you kicking me out too?

10:24.100 --> 10:26.360
Enough with the crocodile tears.

10:26.360 --> 10:30.610
They're not! I can at least be
with you for a while, right?!

10:30.610 --> 10:33.860
Have you come to hate me too?!

10:33.860 --> 10:38.490
Um... Did it actually come as a shock?

10:38.490 --> 10:40.300
Akane saying that she hates you...

10:40.300 --> 10:44.370
Yeah, she never said
that to me even once!

10:44.370 --> 10:49.510
No matter how bad my prank is
she would never be really angry at me!

10:49.510 --> 10:53.710
I... have made her hate me.

10:53.710 --> 10:57.890
She won't talk to me again forever!

10:58.960 --> 11:00.870
That's really troublesome...

11:02.640 --> 11:03.670
Sorry...

11:04.890 --> 11:06.170
What are you doing?!

11:09.150 --> 11:10.270
Why are you stripping?!

11:10.610 --> 11:13.970
It's my fault she kicked you
out of the house...

11:13.970 --> 11:16.620
So I must take responsibility...

11:17.370 --> 11:19.780
At least let me repay you with my body.

11:19.780 --> 11:23.170
I don't need that!
Like I can do that with a crying kid!

11:23.170 --> 11:25.040
I'm not crying anymore!

11:25.040 --> 11:27.790
I'm not a kid, I'm an adult!
I can do that!

11:27.790 --> 11:28.470
Don't!

11:28.470 --> 11:29.570
Shut up!

11:29.570 --> 11:32.140
I'm offering my service as an apology,

11:32.140 --> 11:34.340
so just do as I say!

11:36.640 --> 11:40.800
I'll allow you to sleep here today.
So just go to bed.

11:41.270 --> 11:43.250
Will you put me to sleep?

11:43.250 --> 11:44.810
I'll do anything.

11:45.140 --> 11:46.810
What about giving me an arm pillow?

11:49.830 --> 11:51.320
Oh, fine.

11:52.830 --> 11:56.780
You two sisters sure are
troublemakers together.

12:01.830 --> 12:03.260
Hey, you all right?

12:03.740 --> 12:04.870
Are you feeling sick?

12:04.870 --> 12:09.580
I have my usual medicine,
but I didn't take one last night...

12:09.580 --> 12:12.330
So you're still sick?

12:12.330 --> 12:16.130
If I take my medicine,
I can move like a normal person.

12:16.130 --> 12:18.110
I just get tired so easily,

12:18.110 --> 12:21.760
so I won't collapse
if I can manage my health.

12:21.760 --> 12:23.350
Why didn't you take it?

12:23.790 --> 12:25.490
I couldn't.

12:25.490 --> 12:30.280
When she kicked me out last night,
I didn't have time to grab it.

12:30.280 --> 12:33.540
I thought I'd be fine for a night...

12:33.990 --> 12:35.360
I guess I was wrong.

12:35.360 --> 12:36.670
We should call an ambulance...

12:36.670 --> 12:37.910
No!

12:40.220 --> 12:43.940
If you call an ambulance,
they'll call my family too.

12:43.940 --> 12:47.550
It'll turn big, and my sister will find out!

12:48.370 --> 12:50.870
This is no time to say that...

12:50.870 --> 12:53.710
This kind of thing happens a lot...

12:53.710 --> 12:57.980
The doctor also says
I can live normally again.

12:57.980 --> 12:59.130
Really?

12:59.130 --> 13:04.460
Yes. I still have a lot of things
I want to do...

13:04.960 --> 13:07.390
I won't lie for something like this.

13:08.830 --> 13:10.870
I hope you won't.

13:14.620 --> 13:16.900
I've never been carried
like a princess like this.

13:17.380 --> 13:19.420
You seem used to this.

13:19.420 --> 13:22.090
I once did this to your sister too.

13:23.160 --> 13:27.010
Could you two not actually...

13:27.010 --> 13:29.160
...be on bad terms?

13:29.570 --> 13:31.420
We had always been nemeses.

13:32.150 --> 13:34.170
But right now, I don't know.

13:34.670 --> 13:36.580
HEIANDAI MEDICAL CENTRE

13:36.580 --> 13:37.170
HEIANDAI MEDICAL CENTRE
I did it again after a long while...

13:37.170 --> 13:38.820
I did it again after a long while...

13:39.780 --> 13:42.640
Seems like your parents
are on the way here.

13:42.640 --> 13:45.750
Things'll be complicated if I stay,
so I'm going now.

13:45.750 --> 13:47.050
Wait!

13:47.050 --> 13:47.680
What?

13:47.680 --> 13:49.050
Please.

13:49.470 --> 13:52.180
Don't tell her about this.

13:52.180 --> 13:54.230
The fact that you got hospitalised?

13:54.230 --> 13:55.690
And the fact that I collapsed.

13:55.690 --> 13:58.190
She'd want to come visit you.

13:58.190 --> 13:59.440
That won't do.

13:59.440 --> 14:01.370
It's because I'm so weak,

14:01.370 --> 14:05.200
that I've always troubled
her since I was little.

14:05.750 --> 14:08.530
Because she always took care of me,

14:08.530 --> 14:11.460
she couldn't befriend anyone.

14:11.870 --> 14:14.000
The main reason is her personality.

14:14.000 --> 14:18.540
She's just too kind, I can't have her
keep worrying about me.

14:18.990 --> 14:24.720
I don't want her to abandon
what she wants to do just for me.

14:25.280 --> 14:28.220
Okay. Not a single word to Akane.

14:28.220 --> 14:32.740
Sorry for troubling you too, Brother.

14:33.840 --> 14:34.720
What?

14:34.720 --> 14:37.060
Sorry, but I can't go home for some time.

14:37.060 --> 14:39.510
Do you mind if I stay at your place?

14:39.510 --> 14:41.290
Had a fight with Akane?

14:41.290 --> 14:43.990
Yeah, quite a quarrel we had too.

14:43.990 --> 14:44.970
Gonna divorce her?

14:44.970 --> 14:47.490
I... wonder.

14:47.870 --> 14:51.310
I happen to be in a car now,
I'll come collect you.

14:51.310 --> 14:53.180
We'll go straight to the court...

14:53.180 --> 14:55.000
We're still not splitting yet!

14:57.340 --> 15:00.250
Do you know where my sister went?

15:00.250 --> 15:02.150
She's not coming to school since then,

15:02.150 --> 15:05.760
and my parents just told me randomly
that she "went on another trip".

15:05.760 --> 15:07.490
Maybe she really did.

15:07.490 --> 15:10.510
Then she should've said
something to me before going.

15:10.960 --> 15:14.010
I can't reach her,
and my messages aren't read by her.

15:14.010 --> 15:15.520
There's something strange here.

15:15.870 --> 15:17.620
She'll eventually be back.

15:17.620 --> 15:20.940
How can you tell?
So you do know something about this?

15:20.940 --> 15:23.530
You're close with her,
so you must've heard from her.

15:23.890 --> 15:25.150
We're not really close.

15:25.150 --> 15:26.160
Yeah, right!

15:26.160 --> 15:29.680
Class is about to start now,
so I'm going in.

15:30.130 --> 15:31.860
Wait!

15:31.860 --> 15:35.470
When are you... coming back...

15:38.290 --> 15:43.680
This is the stuff! Nothing beats junk food
you eat without the doctor knowing!

15:43.680 --> 15:46.800
I'm the one who gets an earful
if I spoil you too much.

15:47.230 --> 15:49.300
Did you always beg Akane?

15:50.870 --> 15:54.140
Sis definitely wouldn't buy it for me.

15:55.230 --> 15:59.390
You sure travel a lot despite
having such a frail body.

15:59.890 --> 16:02.340
I'm scared.

16:02.340 --> 16:03.070
Of what?

16:03.430 --> 16:08.060
I don't know when I can't get up again.

16:08.060 --> 16:10.750
I don't know when I will die.

16:11.270 --> 16:17.330
That's why I want to do
what I've longed for since little now.

16:17.710 --> 16:19.010
I see.

16:19.010 --> 16:25.520
Also, if I can go abroad cheerfully,
she'll feel at ease.

16:26.360 --> 16:29.610
She doesn't have to see me
when I'm feeling sick too.

16:30.490 --> 16:34.740
Do you also keep it from her
if you're not feeling well too?

16:34.740 --> 16:35.550
Yeah.

16:36.080 --> 16:39.470
I've always worried her, after all.

16:39.980 --> 16:43.730
She just loves me too much.

16:44.990 --> 16:47.990
Did you also seduce me for her?

16:47.990 --> 16:49.240
Huh?

16:49.690 --> 16:53.060
At first, I thought you were
going to get your sister back

16:53.060 --> 16:55.570
since you were mad
I took her from you.

16:55.570 --> 17:00.750
But I was wrong.
You just wanted her to be happy.

17:00.750 --> 17:03.000
How'd you find out?

17:03.360 --> 17:06.800
I caught a glimpse of it
when your hostility toward me weakened.

17:07.500 --> 17:10.350
Sure, you do hate me,

17:10.350 --> 17:14.290
but it's not the hostility shown toward
someone who separated you with your sister.

17:14.980 --> 17:19.020
I bathe in people's loath
every day, so I can tell.

17:19.380 --> 17:20.550
I give up.

17:21.120 --> 17:22.730
You're totally right.

17:22.730 --> 17:27.900
I've already heard long ago
about a guy she hates most in class.

17:28.460 --> 17:33.010
She was always frustrated
that he always took the first rank from her.

17:33.690 --> 17:37.620
It's just too cruel to be forced
to marry such guy, huh?

17:37.620 --> 17:40.040
Yeah, it's so outrageous.

17:40.040 --> 17:45.790
If she has to suffer,
then I might as well replace her.

17:46.490 --> 17:50.480
This time, I want her to do
the things she wants to.

17:52.230 --> 17:56.750
Does that mean you should marry me
and not someone else you like?

17:56.750 --> 17:59.650
Did I make a mistake?

17:59.650 --> 18:03.940
My sister was super pissed,
and I'm sure she despised me.

18:04.310 --> 18:07.330
I guess I'm done for...

18:08.320 --> 18:11.570
Akane still loves you even now.

18:11.950 --> 18:14.710
I'll stay by your side,
so get some rest.

18:15.170 --> 18:18.720
And show her that you're
healthy again soon.

18:25.080 --> 18:28.060
Your hand feels so good...

18:28.060 --> 18:31.180
It's not like my sister's,
but it's calming.

18:31.180 --> 18:33.500
I used to put Shisei to sleep too, after all.

18:33.500 --> 18:36.850
Why are you looking after me?

18:37.460 --> 18:38.630
Well...

18:39.660 --> 18:42.530
Because I also wish for Akane's happiness.

18:42.970 --> 18:46.610
If you feel lonely, so will she.

18:47.120 --> 18:50.580
I hate to see her smile gone.

18:50.580 --> 18:53.650
Her smile is so cute, right?

18:53.650 --> 18:56.410
Yeah, I'll admit that.

18:59.990 --> 19:01.200
Akane?!

19:10.310 --> 19:13.070
Because I also wish for Akane's happiness.

19:14.820 --> 19:17.470
What is he talking... about?

19:18.890 --> 19:21.390
A WEEK LATER

19:21.390 --> 19:23.270
Sorry, Sis!

19:23.270 --> 19:27.590
I had always seduced him
since I came here,

19:27.590 --> 19:31.530
because I wanted to replace you
so you wouldn’t have to suffer!

19:31.900 --> 19:35.400
So your hugging him
in the bedroom was for that too?

19:35.840 --> 19:39.970
I worked so hard,
but he was just super serious.

19:39.970 --> 19:41.780
He'd never lay a hand on me.

19:41.780 --> 19:42.660
Maybe...

19:42.660 --> 19:44.160
He doesn't have those below!

19:44.160 --> 19:47.120
Really? I knew that was the case.

19:47.120 --> 19:47.650
Hey.

19:47.650 --> 19:50.000
Nah, I kid! He does have those!

19:50.000 --> 19:52.830
- We went to bath tog...
- Oh, you just hush.

19:54.110 --> 19:56.680
That's why he's innocent!

19:56.680 --> 20:00.790
In fact, he'd always come visit me,
and he's a good guy!

20:00.790 --> 20:02.780
Please forgive him!

20:02.780 --> 20:06.690
If you say so, then I'll consider it.

20:07.040 --> 20:11.020
But please, don't say anything like
trying to replace me as sacrifice anymore.

20:11.020 --> 20:11.810
Why?

20:11.810 --> 20:15.690
I want my precious
little sister to live happily.

20:15.690 --> 20:19.570
I should be the only one
suffering from the pain of this hell.

20:19.570 --> 20:20.950
That much?!

20:20.950 --> 20:25.660
But, Sis, I think I'm starting
to love him for real.

20:25.660 --> 20:28.580
That's why I'll make him mine.

20:29.330 --> 20:34.190
Saito! How dare you trick my little sister!

20:34.590 --> 20:38.570
Just you wait!
I'll go get my weapon now!

20:38.570 --> 20:43.360
By the way, I know who the girl
at your party was!

20:43.360 --> 20:45.600
Huh? It wasn't you?

20:45.600 --> 20:49.600
If you kiss me, I'll tell you.
Smooch...

20:49.600 --> 20:51.610
Go back to your own classroom!

20:55.340 --> 20:56.010
Akane.

20:56.010 --> 20:56.940
What?

20:56.940 --> 20:59.360
Um, I'm sorry.

20:59.360 --> 21:00.830
Why are you apologising?

21:00.830 --> 21:04.370
Is it because you made not only my best friend,
but also my sister swoon for you?

21:04.370 --> 21:07.120
Trying to say sorry for being popular?

21:08.560 --> 21:12.500
There's something
I want to make sure from you.

21:12.500 --> 21:13.380
What is it?

21:13.890 --> 21:19.130
Is it true that you said you wish
for my happiness back at the hospital?

21:20.310 --> 21:21.490
Well, that's...

21:21.490 --> 21:23.640
Answer me honestly,
or I won't forgive you!

21:26.010 --> 21:27.140
It's true.

21:29.780 --> 21:30.640
I'm so happy.

21:31.650 --> 21:32.950
Well...

21:33.530 --> 21:36.020
You'd better come back home soon.

21:36.020 --> 21:37.620
A-Are you sure?

21:37.620 --> 21:41.910
I'm not! I hate having to sleep
in the same bed with you,

21:41.910 --> 21:47.380
but if you leave for too long,
Grandma and your grandpa might find out.

21:47.380 --> 21:50.020
And I'm the one who'll get scolded...

21:50.900 --> 21:54.970
Well, I guess so.
I'll go back home, then.

21:54.970 --> 21:55.910
Okay.

21:57.330 --> 21:58.420
I knew it...

21:58.910 --> 22:03.190
Akane is living together with Saito...

23:35.020 --> 23:41.110
#10 GIRLFRIEND (TEMP.)
